  "steps": [
    "Steam the sprouts for 3-4 minutes until just tender, or leave raw if you prefer more crunch, then cool them.",
    "Combine the sprouts, cucumber, tomato and green chilli in a bowl.",
    "Add the chaat masala, roasted cumin powder and salt.",
    "Squeeze in the lemon juice and toss gently.",
    "Garnish with coriander leaves and serve fresh."
  ]
